Z||000000||Cooter||10-23-2000||11:19 PM||||My recent water leak damaged the boxes and packing materials for several Action die cast cars. Where can I find an accurate value of these cars? I have a Earnhart Wheaties and Olympics, Gordon ChromaIllusion, and several others. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||10-24-2000||03:33 AM||||Try Beckets Racing Collectables Magazine. Find the listed value and then subtract about 15%-30% for an acurate (what you can really sell them for) price.||||reg||1
